{"4434910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HollowCity:EscapeFromSeoul", "steam_appid": 4434910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4881740, 4768700], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434910/extras/ce32d862dedce5e463fb098c2ca61605.avif?t=1788291657\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself stranded in the city with no idea why. However, to survive and ultimately escape, you must gather loot and prepare from your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434910/extras/0be4ab30d8fb3e7e1d2b3798ad00b81c.poster.avif?t=1788291657\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434910/extras/0be4ab30d8fb3e7e1d2b3798ad00b81c.webm?t=1788291657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434910/extras/0be4ab30d8fb3e7e1d2b3798ad00b81c.mp4?t=1788291657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo or up to 4-Player Co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In a city that seems to have nothing left but despair, you must find a way out. You can choose to face this challenge alone, or team up with reliable allies. Scour various themed districts for weapons and supplies. Sometimes you'll find what you need in a discarded trash can; other times, you'll have to take it by force. Remember: in this dying world, others are always looking to steal what’s yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434910/extras/b942b8740795fae7b70217bba2863cf9.poster.avif?t=1788291657\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434910/extras/b942b8740795fae7b70217bba2863cf9.webm?t=1788291657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434910/extras/b942b8740795fae7b70217bba2863cf9.mp4?t=1788291657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survivors who help you in their own way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One hands you the supplies you need, another passes along better gear, and someone else tends to your wounds when you come back from outside. And as you keep venturing out to explore, you may come across other survivors willing to join you. Though of course, you'll have to be just as willing to help them with their own troubles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434910/extras/ce32d862dedce5e463fb098c2ca61605.avif?t=1788291657\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself stranded in the city with no idea why. However, to survive and ultimately escape, you must gather loot and prepare from your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434910/extras/0be4ab30d8fb3e7e1d2b3798ad00b81c.poster.avif?t=1788291657\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434910/extras/0be4ab30d8fb3e7e1d2b3798ad00b81c.webm?t=1788291657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434910/extras/0be4ab30d8fb3e7e1d2b3798ad00b81c.mp4?t=1788291657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo or up to 4-Player Co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In a city that seems to have nothing left but despair, you must find a way out. You can choose to face this challenge alone, or team up with reliable allies. Scour various themed districts for weapons and supplies. Sometimes you'll find what you need in a discarded trash can; other times, you'll have to take it by force. Remember: in this dying world, others are always looking to steal what’s yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434910/extras/b942b8740795fae7b70217bba2863cf9.poster.avif?t=1788291657\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434910/extras/b942b8740795fae7b70217bba2863cf9.webm?t=1788291657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434910/extras/b942b8740795fae7b70217bba2863cf9.mp4?t=1788291657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survivors who help you in their own way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One hands you the supplies you need, another passes along better gear, and someone else tends to your wounds when you come back from outside. And as you keep venturing out to explore, you may come across other survivors willing to join you. Though of course, you'll have to be just as willing to help them with their own troubles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "'HollowCity' is a PvE top-down extraction shooter set in a ruined city. Solo or with up to 4 players, you must explore various zones and gather survival supplies. Hostile humans aren't the only threats to your life. Fight through monsters born from unknown causes and escape safely.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Vietnamese, French, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434910/346382b222dc53a6fd012b6afc5335da93334bba/header.jpg?t=1788291657", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434910/0a1a5133dd4cda7266f6e6259c6744c17c5f5a00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788291657", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434910/0a1a5133dd4cda7266f6e6259c6744c17c5f5a00/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788291657", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core i5 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 560</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["StudioHeorang"], "publishers": ["StudioHeorang"], "demos": [{"appid": 4881740, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434910/95406dc46656fae68118856aa03bfce261478638/ss_95406dc46656fae68118856aa03bfce261478638.600x338.jpg?t=1788291657", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434910/95406dc46656fae68118856aa03bfce261478638/ss_95406dc466